      "content": "Yeah, fine, go check. But honestly, if you're looking at the same data I am, you'll see we're in a bit of a bind here. We've got a production line that's going to stall if we don't get this steel on site ASAP. \n\nIf you can't move on the price, I'm not sure I can get approval to sign this today. My bosses aren't going to want to pay a premium just because there's a \"glitch\" in your reporting. If you can find a way to shave even a few cents off the unit cost, I can probably push them to sign before your 24-hour window closes. Let me know what you find.",
